WEBVTT

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.760
Previously on Enterprise.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.800
We only want to be your partners.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.040
Work together in common course.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.370
Admiral Forrest has been killed.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.410
The DNA on the bomb's controls was left by this one.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:17.540
Kapow!

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.820
The answers you need are on Vulcan.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.300
And however far you have to take this investigation,

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.400
you have my support.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:27.650
This is a desert called the Forge.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.980
The Roots, the one Surak, Sabu...

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.650
The guard recognized the person who brought in the bomb we found in the rubble.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:37.190
T'Pau.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.530
No, it was you.

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:41.930
What's a Katra?

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.480
Cyrenites claim it's the essence of a Vulcan mind,

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:48.320
that it can be transferred from the body before death.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:50.740
Wasp was involved with the attack on your embassy.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:53.650
He's responsible for blaming it on the Cyrenites.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:17.900
Before we announce our decisions, is there anything you wish to say?

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:24.220
My actions were taken in the best interest of Vulcan and the High Command.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:28.030
Keeping secrets from us is in our best interest.

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:29.970
Had I revealed my ability...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.700
as a melder my years of service would not have been possible your accomplishments have been

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:43.740
noteworthy they don't justify deception deception has never been a stranger to this room i caution

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:49.850
you one of our own members was responsible for bombing the earth embassy an act we tried to

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:55.420
blame on the syrenites that assessment was correct our investigation of stel has revealed

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:59.480
he's a syrenite i find that difficult to accept

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.100
documents were discovered in his home. The evidence is irrefutable. Syronites

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:10.080
were responsible and they'll be dealt with accordingly. Regarding the matter at

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:15.480
hand, your position is terminated immediately. You're to surrender all

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:20.360
classified materials to the security directorate before leaving. I remind you

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:27.010
that your loyalty oath is still in effect. Violation of that oath. I'm aware of the

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:27.450
Penalty.

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:28.330
Good.

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:29.970
Is there a...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.600
Anything else you'd like to say?

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:38.940
There's a great deal that needs to be said excellency, but no one's willing to listen.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:12.540
Yeah, I'm all right.

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:23.820
Jonathan Archer.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:26.560
Son of the Earth vessel.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:29.970
And you must be T'Pol.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.530
You're a long way from Enterprise.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.840
I'm here to find the person who bombed the Earth Embassy.

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:44.250
Her name is T'Pau.

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:47.550
She looks a hell of a lot like you.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.340
I am T'Pau.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.880
You murdered my friend, along with 40 other people.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:56.300
I had nothing to do with the destruction of your embassy.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:58.110
The evidence says you did.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.080
I haven't left this desert for two years.

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:04.910
What does that tell you about your evidence?

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:06.410
It tells me that you're lying.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:10.050
You have a lot to learn about Sirenites.

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:11.350
You have a lot to learn about humans.

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:14.540
We don't sit back and do nothing while our people are attacked.

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:18.020
No, you traverse vast wastelands based on false information.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:23.650
What did you plan to do when you found me?

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:26.300
Place me under arrest?

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:27.800
Something like that.

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:29.960
Seems everything I've heard...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:39.240
about your species is accurate mother i'm pleased to see that you're all right we have a great deal

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:51.060
to talk about agreed told them where to find us yes is there anyone else with you to have crossed the

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:56.630
forge by yourselves with the sand fire storms this time of year we met a syrenite he helped

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:59.020
us find shelter who was this person

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.960
His name was Erev.

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:06.490
He was struck down by an electrical charge.

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:07.570
He didn't make it.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:08.940
He's dead?

00:06:11.780 --> 00:06:13.480
Are you certain his name was Erev?

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:15.030
That's what he told us.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:20.190
His true name was Sirin.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:23.690
He was our leader.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.490
Captain, are you all right?

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:44.730
I'm okay.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:54.940
Right before Arav died, he grabbed me, put his hand on my forehead.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:59.090
I felt something inside my head.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:03.320
Do you think he was trying to meld with you?

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:12.630
I don't know. I haven't been myself.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:22.670
Put us all in danger. What if they've been followed?

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:25.310
I only wanted her to know I was safe.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.220
Would have accomplished that without revealing our location.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:29.780
I can't, but I've done.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.730
She doesn't deserve imprisonment. I want her released.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.270
Not until we've confirmed their story.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:36.880
My daughter won't lie.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.440
She's not merely your daughter.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:43.210
She's a member of Starfleet, and Starfleet is allied with the High Command.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.530
They'll both remain where they are until I'm satisfied they can be trusted.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.380
Search patrols are flying day and night.

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:56.010
They're the least of our worries now.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:58.800
If Siren is dead.

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:04.410
Then everything we've worked for is lost.

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:10.920
I can't believe they threw you out.

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:13.110
Just because you helped us?

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:15.160
I knew the risks.

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.690
There's got to be some way you can fight this.

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:20.450
I could protest, but it wouldn't accomplish anything.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.200
Bloss isn't one to change his mind.

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:24.980
Who the hell put him in charge anyway?

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:27.780
Our society rewards merit.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.900
Bloss has demonstrated a singular...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:38.840
talent for governing what are you gonna do now you're referring to my career I

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:44.360
haven't given it much thought there's something more important we need to

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:49.180
discuss if you made contact with T'Pol or your captain you can't reach them and

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:55.320
they can't reach us Bloss is determined to wipe out the Syronites he's

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:59.070
particularly intent on destroying their encampment in the forge

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:04.430
Where the Captain and T'Pol are headed, they may be in grave danger.

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:26.160
You must have questions for me.

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:34.160
I can't understand how you could join these people.

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:39.270
I've been growing disillusioned with Vulcan society for some time.

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:47.050
When I was forced to resign from the Academy, I ran seriously to question my beliefs.

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:50.030
And this is where you came for answers?

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:58.750
Cyrenites believe that the Vulcans have strayed from the teachings of Surak.

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:09.920
Considering what the High Command has done in recent years, the listening station at Pajam, suppression of dissent, our position isn't so hard to accept.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.270
You could have told me all this when I came to visit.

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:18.220
The High Command was just beginning to hunt down suspected Sirenites.

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.800
I was afraid I would be next. I wanted to keep you out of it.

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:27.670
I know your marriage to Kos was for my sake. Help me regain my post.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:29.490
I don't want your apologies, Mother.

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:32.510
I want you to come back with me.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:40.270
Can't do that.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.020
You gave me that map.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.520
You knew I'd try to find you.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:51.900
I thought that if you could see what we were trying to accomplish...

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:52.720
That I'd understand.

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:56.280
That I'd join you.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:10:58.780
Held out that hope.

00:10:59.280 --> 00:10:59.580
Yes.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:04.960
It's possible I was being foolish, extreme.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:59.980
is taking its toll. Vulcan is tearing itself. I know who I am, Captain. Death, or deb-

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:02.810
I believe this will become known as the time of awakening.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:06.260
It was 1800 years ago.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:16.750
I feel like a dream.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.500
The scene passed through my eyes.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:29.910
Siren did something to me before he died.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:32.360
He chose you.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:36.680
You don't trust Vulcans, Captain.

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:40.320
Given your experiences with them, I can't say I blame you.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:44.480
Culture you've come to know isn't the one I helped to create.

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:50.200
My people have strayed, and someone must restore them.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:54.800
You've got the wrong man.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:56.440
Sorry, Captain.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:58.500
There's an Earth expression.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:12:59.960
We're stuck with each other.

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.000
Don't fight what's been given to you.

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:09.540
Open your mind and your heart, and the way will become clear.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:11.080
Captain.

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:14.390
Captain.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:29.900
We've pinpointed their location.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.140
near the northeastern border of the forge.

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:35.140
How accurate is this information?

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:37.460
It's based on data collected by search patrols.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.080
They've been conducting missions for several days.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:44.910
We're going to bombard the camp with photonic weapons.

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:48.400
Our goal isn't to exterminate these people.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:52.490
Our goal is to maintain order.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:54.870
They're in the deep desert.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.520
What possible harm could they do us?

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.020
They've already destroyed an embassy.

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:07.830
Eventually, they're going to have to leave the forge, and when they do, we can apprehend them with little or no loss of light.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:11.830
It's very likely that Sirin himself is inside the compound.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:17.960
With one decisive thrust, we can cripple this insurgency, perhaps end it.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.130
We can't let an opportunity like this pass us by.

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:24.670
A surgical strike could minimize the loss of light.

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:27.960
The geomagnetic anomalies make a precision attack impossible.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:41.860
the only way we'll begin preparations immediately this man did he tell you his

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:53.170
name he seemed to think I knew who he was did you it was Surak we believe you

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:59.890
sir and possessed the Katra of Surak Katras are nothing more than a myth I used to

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:06.920
that until i learned to open up my mind to other possibilities if siren knew he was close to death

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:15.290
he would have tried to transfer the cotra to someone else i was near him when he died there's

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:22.160
only one way to be certain i have to meld with you i've had my fill of mind melts the prospect

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:29.680
doesn't appeal to me either i've never melded with a human before your unchecked emotions will

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:57.910
doubt proved distasteful. However, I ask your indulgence to your mind, to your thoughts.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:05.660
Our minds are one.

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:13.000
In the desert, there's a storm.

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:18.960
Find refuge in a cave.

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:24.290
Sand lightning. Our minds are not alone.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.500
There's someone else. Here, listen.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:30.800
I sense his presence.

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:50.810
Trigger a malfunction in this satellite's imaging node.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:53.090
It takes six minutes for the central processor

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:53.950
to correct the error.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.090
That should be enough time to slip through the net.

00:16:57.400 --> 00:16:58.520
They wonder what caused the glitch.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:16:59.970
Errors occur frequently.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:09.340
near the forge. It shouldn't raise suspicion. Mind if I ask you something? Why are you doing

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:16.490
this? I never got the impression you cared that much about humans. Seems like you were always

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:22.970
finding something new to complain about. I lived on Earth for more than 30 years, Commander. In

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:29.850
that time, I developed an affinity for your world and its people. You did a pretty good job.

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:32.330
Thank you.

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:36.060
Tucker.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.160
Go ahead, Travis.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.120
We should be ready within the hour.

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:42.670
What about health control?

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:45.160
I've rigged up a stick and rudder system.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:48.840
It'll get us where we want to go, but I can't promise a smooth ride.

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.660
Just don't tell Malcolm about that part until you're underway.

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:58.420
Centuries ago, a set of Kotrick arcs were discovered at the Vishen Monastery.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:06.700
Polycrystalline vessels, allegedly used by ancient Vulcans to preserve cotras.

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:15.430
They were scanned, analyzed. One of the scientists even attempted to meld with them.

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:19.580
They found nothing to indicate the presence of a cotra.

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:24.060
The Vulcan Science Academy was just as skeptical about time travel.

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:29.420
Do you really believe you possess the living spirit of Sorok?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.450
inside you, a man who died 1,800 years ago.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.310
Now when you put it like that.

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:40.730
There is a logical explanation.

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:41.920
I'm listening.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:46.780
Siren melded with you before he died.

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:51.180
What you're experiencing is the residue of his thoughts.

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:56.460
So I'm suffering from mind meld hangover?

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:59.250
I wouldn't characterize it quite that way.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:01.870
But essentially...

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:07.320
It feels like more than that.

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:09.820
You have no basis for comparison.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.570
You've never undergone a mind-bill before.

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.240
Seeing Surak is only a part of it.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:18.870
I can swear I've been here before, in this sanctuary.

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.670
It's like coming back to the house you grew up in.

00:19:23.980 --> 00:19:25.620
Siren spent a great deal of time here.

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:29.500
Let's say you're right.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.540
And it was just a mind melder.

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:38.940
He still put something in my head, and I want to take him out.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.920
It may not be possible.

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:50.820
What can we do for you?

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.100
Where is your captain?

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:54.660
He's indisposed at the moment.

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:55.730
Can I help you?

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:59.090
The investigation of the embassy bombing is nearly complete.

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.120
You have a suspect.

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:05.390
The evidence against him and the Sirenites is compelling.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.390
There's no longer any need for your presence here.

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:12.020
If it's all the same to you, we'd like to stick around.

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:13.860
We'd prefer you didn't.

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:15.270
This is an internal matter.

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.450
We'll keep Starfleet apprised if there are any subsequent developments.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:21.430
Excellency...

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:24.390
Again, you have my deepest sympathy for your loss.

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:26.560
All of Vulcan grieves with you.

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:29.600
With all respect, we aren't leaving.

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:32.190
Not until we know exactly what happened.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:34.760
I've also contacted Admiral Gardner.

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:36.640
I'm sure you'll be hearing from him soon.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:38.400
A pleasant journey.

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:42.040
Son of a bitch hung up on us.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:43.510
Should I try to get him back?

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:49.020
No one here has ever performed this ritual.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:50.740
I've studied it for some time.

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:53.750
I believe I can conduct it successfully.

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:57.170
You'd not only be placing Sir X. Katra in jeopardy,

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:57.990
you could kill Archer.

00:20:58.470 --> 00:20:59.830
The risks are acceptable.

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:02.550
I doubt Surak would agree.

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:04.270
What alternative would you suggest?

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:05.860
That we follow this human?

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:10.230
I believe your prejudice towards humans is clouding your judgment.

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:12.130
Question of my logic?

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:19.290
Siren chose to place the carniture.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:23.690
He must have had his reasons, even if we understand them.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:29.700
Of dying, your daughter couldn't reach him in time yet.

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:42.730
sake of everyone involved. I ask you to reconsider. I've made my decision. I'll

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:51.080
perform the procedure in one hour. Richard dies. Sacrifice our future to protect the

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.000
life of one human.

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:12.480
No, I'm the one with the Vulcan ghost in his head, depending on who you believe.

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:19.670
I don't feel half as bad as you look.

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:24.020
Considering our option.

00:22:27.430 --> 00:22:28.450
At least we know your mother's okay.

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:32.180
She's joined a violent cult.

00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:34.510
It's not okay.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:39.180
I don't think these people had anything to do with the embassy.

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:41.820
You sound convinced.

00:22:43.460 --> 00:22:46.150
Let's just say it's more than a gut feeling.

00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:54.360
We've come to a decision.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:56.890
The courtroom must be removed.

00:22:59.140 --> 00:22:59.980
I can't argue with that.

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:03.010
There's a procedure, a ritual.

00:23:03.890 --> 00:23:06.030
It will transfer the culture to another person.

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:07.570
It's not without risk.

00:23:08.680 --> 00:23:12.310
